------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights and runtime published with each release
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

These are release assets, not repository files (the potion model's small
config.json is the one exception): downloaded after install and checked
against the release's SHA256SUMS.

model-int8.safetensors, tokenizer.json -- a static embedding model:

    potion-multilingual-128M
    Copyright (c) MinishLab
    MIT License
    https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-multilingual-128M

Distilled from BAAI/bge-m3 (MIT), whose tokenizer it uses. `tokenizer.json`
and `config.json` are potion-multilingual-128M's own files, unmodified.
`model-int8.safetensors` is its `embeddings` tensor quantized from f32 to int8;
the transformation and its checksums are in
assets/potion-multilingual-128M/PROVENANCE.md.

reranker-int8.onnx, reranker-tokenizer.json -- a cross-encoder:

    bge-reranker-v2-m3
    Copyright (c) BAAI (Beijing Academy of Artificial Intelligence)
    Apache License 2.0
    https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3

Converted from the ONNX export at
https://huggingface.co/EmbeddedLLM/bge-reranker-v2-m3-onnx-o3-cpu, which
declares no license of its own. Modified: the weights are quantized to int8.
`reranker-tokenizer.json` is that export's tokenizer, unmodified. The pinned
revision, the transformation and the checksums are in
assets/bge-reranker-v2-m3-int8/PROVENANCE.md.

onnxruntime-<target> -- the library that runs the reranker:

    ONNX Runtime
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
    MIT License
    https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

Copied unmodified from Microsoft's release archives; versions and checksums
are in assets/bge-reranker-v2-m3-int8/PROVENANCE.md.

